Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:32:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(04-33): gated chunking profile create, record,
 activate, rollback and coverage (0413)

- rag_activate_chunking_profile refuses with named reasons (not_ready, incomplete, legacy_kinds_dropped, open_gaps, no_evidence, eval_failed, stale_evidence)
- rollback restores previous_active_id or legacy; coverage counts documents missing from each profile
- legacy_kinds_kept keeps picture captions and invoice headers served from legacy rows beside an active profile (source_images)

